+
+## Enhanced identity capability
+
+`bb.experimental_p6rIdentity` is an optional host capability consumed through
+`@phosphorco/bb-identity/bb`. Identity-aware features call `bindBbIdentity(bb)`
+and use its public request, provider, state, and acceptance interfaces. Do not
+construct raw invocation scopes or infer an actor from headers or loopback.
+A configured provider failure remains blocked; an absent capability uses the
+package's documented baseline behavior. Native app presence and ordinary-message
+attribution are separate host features, not implied by this capability.
